From c5c5ab6b3b58e8793425735949b301d3377934b2 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: bryanfrisco <bryanfrisco24@gmail.com>
Date: Wed, 12 Aug 2026 10:06:45 +0700
Subject: [PATCH] feat(final-invoice): label CIF Price Calculation Limonite
 ikut Excel 1.20% + baris Ni > 1.20% Bonus

Tab Calculate ore type Limonite disamakan dengan format Excel finance
(basis Ni 1,20%), tanpa mengubah rumus yang sudah ada:

- relabel: Ni 1.3% FOB -> Ni 1.20% FOB Price, Ni > 1.3% Bonus ->
  Ni > 1.30% Bonus, Ni < 1.3% Pinalty -> Ni < 1.20% Penalty,
  Ni < 1% Pinalty -> Ni < 1.00% Penalty, CO Bonus -> Co Bonus,
  H2O Pinalty -> H2O Penalty, FOB/CIF Amount -> Final FOB Price /
  Total CIF Price
- baris baru Ni > 1.20% Bonus (lm_ni_bonus_12) dengan rumus sama seperti
  tier bonus lain: unit / 0,01 * price, ikut dijumlah ke Final FOB Price
- nama field lama dipertahankan supaya data invoice Limonite lama tidak
  perlu dimigrasi

Ore type Saprolite, Saprolite HPM Baru, dan invoice Provisional tidak
tersentuh. Printout Lim 1.20% menyusul di update terpisah.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
---
 asb_invoice_stargate/models/account_move.py   | 57 +++++++++++++------
 .../views/account_move_views.xml              | 18 +++++-
 2 files changed, 55 insertions(+), 20 deletions(-)

diff --git a/asb_invoice_stargate/models/account_move.py b/asb_invoice_stargate/models/account_move.py
index c7bd308..5614326 100644
--- a/asb_invoice_stargate/models/account_move.py
